OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of homes without power
OL,4,Adue to Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of homes are without power as
OL,7,FStorm Boelo hits the north west of
OL,8,FEngland.
OL,10,FThere is a yellow weather warning for
OL,11,Fthe majority of the North West which is
OL,12,Fexpected to remain in place for most of
OL,13,FSunday 25 October. Parts of Lancashire
OL,14,Fare under an amber weather warning.
OL,16,FAccording to SP Electricity North
OL,17,FWest's website about 944 homes in total
OL,18,Facross Greater Manchester, Lancashire
OL,19,Fand Warrington currently have no power
OL,20,Fwith issues expected to last until
OL,21,Faround 22:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
